  image_file Animator\3D_shape_files_CS\dashboard\Icons\Active_Cruise_Control.png
END_ENTITY hud_image ACC_On
#ENDMYellow



#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset defines HUD settings for VS Visualizer. It causes up to 8 images to be shown. Two of these, ACC_Base(see the top of the first field) and ACC_On (see the third field) are always visible.
#
#The other four images are shown only when a named output variable is nonzero. One of these is the variable Bk_Stat, which indicates whether the brakes are being applied. The other three are based on the Sensor detection variable MagS<<s>>_1, where <<s>> is the current sensor number.
#
#Rather than naming the detection variable for sensor 1 (e.g.,
#MagS1>_1, the name is written with a symbol stack variable <<s>>. This allows the dataset to be used with a sensor that might not be the first one defined.
#
#The three images shown when a detection (MagS<<s>>_1) is nonzero are the car in front and two distance indicators
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Generic Data Lists; { HUD Indicators } ACC Icons for Long Lead
